eioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T19:23:49Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T13:11:06Z","body":"Related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78645","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645911212/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647445629","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2647445629","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2647445629,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dzNB9","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T09:41:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T09:41:12Z","body":"I believe this was fixed already by #101489 in 4.4.beta3.\n\nCan anyone confirm?\n\nI've tested and I _think_ I could reproduce the issue in 4.4.beta2 and not in 4.4.beta3/master, but the freeze isn't super visible on my setup so it's easy to misjudge.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647445629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648052430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2648052430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2648052430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d1hLO","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T13:51:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T14:01:18Z","body":"> I believe this was fixed already by [#101489](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101489) in 4.4.beta3.\n> \n> Can anyone confirm?\n> \n> I've tested and I _think_ I could reproduce the issue in 4.4.beta2 and not in 4.4.beta3/master, but the freeze isn't super visible on my setup so it's easy to misjudge.\n\nI've tested with a debug build, and it is still present.\nAlso, both this issue and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98666 point to the same PR (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/88427) as the cause of the regression. Applying https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101435 does help if the remote tree is collapsed; but if you uncollapse everything in the remote tree, the freeze is present again, while without this patch (current master), even with the remote tree collapsed, the freeze is present. So [it](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101435) helps, but it is not enough.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648052430/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649972043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2649972043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2649972043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d811L","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T07:00:31Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T06:46:11Z","body":"![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f3d00b7-9c6d-4c62-b856-e8fc8fae6b33)\n\nThe main issue now are the TreeItem functions (_namely_ **get_minimum_size**) being repeatedly called for each node. I tried looking into a fix, but I believe the minimum_size dirty flag and variable are reset each time the remote tree is updated (every remote_screne_tree_refresh_interval). If this function is commented out, the issue is around 80% better, with the rest of the slowness coming from how the engine rebuilds each node instead of caching (I think).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649972043/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652781465","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2652781465","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2652781465,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eHjuZ","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T06:29:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T06:29:33Z","body":"One more reports from rocketchat.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652781465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906854163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2906854163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2906854163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tQxMT","user":{"login":"bbbscarter","id":930043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter","html_url":"https://github.com/bbbscarter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-24T14:15:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-24T14:15:03Z","body":"I'm also seeing this on Mac in 4.4.1, and in  4.4.2rc - pauses of several seconds every couple of seconds when using the remote viewer on a scene with thousands of nodes. It unfortunately makes the remote inspector very difficult to use.\n\nI've built locally and run some profiling:\n\n- Despite the icon optimisation mentioned above seemingly being in this build, `EditorNode::get_class_icon` is the main issue.\n- If I comment out icon retrieval, things are better but still slow, this time via `Tree::_determine_hovered_item`.\n\nI've attached both profiles in case it's useful.\n\n[sample_with_icons.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20426562/sample_with_icons.txt)\n[sample_without_icons.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20426561/sample_without_icons.txt)\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906854163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906861008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2906861008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2906861008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tQy3Q","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-24T14:26:23Z","updated_at":"2025-05-24T14:26:23Z","body":"@bbbscarter you can try this build with a possible fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105376","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906861008/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906947908","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2906947908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2906947908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tRIFE","user":{"login":"bbbscarter","id":930043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter",