.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909851035","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102525#issuecomment-2909851035","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102525","id":2909851035,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tcM2b","user":{"login":"bbbscarter","id":930043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter","html_url":"https://github.com/bbbscarter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T13:58:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T13:58:04Z","body":"Combined with #105376, this makes a big difference for me. \n\nIn an dev build:\n- With ~5k nodes, performance goes 'hard to use', to 'good'.\n- At ~25k nodes there is still sluggishness, but it's much better - e.g. pauses of ~300ms vs ~4 seconds.\n\nSo with both these changes it's a big improvement for me; but additional improvements will be required for more nodes.\n\nI've attached profiles of both the 5k and 25k scenarios with both of these changes applied.\n\n[with_icon_and_text_fixes_25k.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20442269/with_icon_and_text_fixes_25k.txt)\n[with_icon_and_text_fixes_5k.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20442270/with_icon_and_tex